class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp; </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">모집분야 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">하드웨어 스타트업</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, ICT </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">융합</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">첨단제조</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">부품소재</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">소프트웨어 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">10</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">기 선발접수 기한 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: 2018. 6. 7.(</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">목</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">) 24:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">선발일정 및 사업내용 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">첨부파일 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">신청대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">창의적 아이디어 또는 기술을 보유 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">예비</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">창업자 및 벤처기업</span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">예비창업자</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">팀</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">개인사업자의 경우 업력</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">나이 제한이 없으나</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">법인사업자는 사업자등록일 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">3</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">년</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">이내</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">접수일 기준</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">경북 지역에 본사 또는 주된 사무소</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">공장포함</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">를 두고 있거나 선정 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">1</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">년이내 경북지역에서 본사</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">또는 주된 사무소</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">공장포함</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">를 이전할 계획이 있는 신청자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">서류 접수</span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">접수방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp; e-mail </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">로만 접수</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">(</span> <u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">gstardreamers@ccei.kr</span></u> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">접수서류 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">첨부파일 참조</span> <br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">발표심사의 경우 별도양식 발송 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 1